Subject: [PATCH] fix(kanban): contain full eligibility faults and preflight
 review pickup [daveey]

Root (happened): eligibility containment covered config loading only, nested provider shapes escaped into later code, and review exemptions preceded host policy enablement. Root (not caught): root-only YAML fixtures and ordinary-lane checks omitted nested provider blocks, review variants and pre-copy resolver faults. Fail closed per candidate across the whole eligibility read; preflight structural review refusal before import; preserve review-owned standard fallback and all custody/quota gates.

Proof: authentic in-tree unchanged reviewer and new dispatch controls 12 passed/14 failed before repair. Retained stable 256-file no-retry sweep: 5641 passed/1 failed/1 skipped. Sole failure expected import despite all routes walled after earlier-check exception; retain production refusal and test zero import plus recovery when walls clear. Five final whole files 21 passed/0 failed, retries OFF. Prior static21 green; current static only stale-main untouched dispatch facade cap, to resolve by canonical clean rebase without cap relaxation. Full fleet remediation, independent review, landing and deployment remain open.
